DetectorTest
└── detectPrices
    ├── given the page states a price in structured data
    │   ├── it reports the structured amount
    │   ├── it does not let regex second-guess that element
    │   └── it does not let regex second-guess anything inside it
    ├── given the structured currency is not enabled
    │   └── it ignores that structured price
    ├── given no structured data
    │   └── it falls back to reading the rendered text
    ├── given the page declares a currency
    │   └── it uses that rather than guessing from the hostname
    ├── given the page declares a language
    │   └── it reads numbers under that language's rules
    ├── given a site adapter identified the element as a price container
    │   └── it lets bare-number patterns run there
    ├── given a parent whose direct text holds its own price
    │   └── it carries that through
    └── given a page with no prices
        └── it reports nothing
